{"id":"2e9af66b-0a83-58f6-b3f5-a480f0f6abab","title":"ShowAI 文档","icon":"📚","cover":"none","parentId":null,"favorite":false,"archived":false,"createdAt":"2026-10-15T00:00:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-20T19:04:43.533Z","content":{"type":"surface","attrs":{"id":"root","kind":"page","name":"ShowAI 文档","widthMode":"standard"},"content":[{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-hero","version":"1.0.0","props":{"eyebrow":"ShowAI 文档","title":"可进化的人机交互界面","lead":"Agent 的回答不再只是一段文字，而是一个可以交互、可以归档、在使用中不断进化的界面。","facts":[{"label":"电脑","value":"Apple Silicon Mac · macOS 13+"},{"label":"Agent","value":"Claude Code · Codex · 内置 Agent"},{"label":"许可","value":"MIT 开源"}],"actions":[{"label":"快速上手","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/quick-start","primary":true},{"label":"下载 ShowAI","href":"https://github.com/Renaissance-Mind/ShowAI/releases/latest"},{"label":"GitHub","href":"https://github.com/Renaissance-Mind/ShowAI"}],"art":"start"},"integrity":"sha256-7c2bbe84b00357b5e96de32cad51cf6537d38c28d4eadca35435483ba772646e"},"id":"node-ed65c2e3"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-ec65c150"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"从这里开始"}]},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-cards","version":"1.0.0","props":{"columns":3,"cards":[{"icon":"🚀","title":"快速上手","tag":"三步开始","tone":"brand","body":"下载 ShowAI，在欢迎页连接你的 Agent，让它做出第一个界面。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/quick-start"},{"icon":"🤝","title":"在 Agent 中使用","tag":"Claude Code · Codex","tone":"teal","body":"支持哪些 Agent、各自的状态，以及 Agent 怎样读写和展示你的页面。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/agent-hosts"},{"icon":"🔍","title":"连接 Agent 时的常见问题","tag":"排错","tone":"warm","body":"Agent 找不到 ShowAI、插件未启用、页面在 App 中找不到时，按情况处理。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/agent-troubleshooting"}]},"integrity":"sha256-96ea3af150bd5892ccd24a456bfe0fa6c6c312635d9b19e4a1bcf063be65ffa1"},"id":"node-ef65c609"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-ee65c476"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"ShowAI 是什么"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Agent 用界面回答你，这个界面有三个性质："}],"attrs":{"id":"node-f165c92f"}},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-cards","version":"1.0.0","props":{"columns":3,"cards":[{"icon":"🎛️","title":"可以交互","tone":"brand","body":"Agent 用图表、计算器、流程图等组件回答，你可以调参数、做对比、展开细节，在操作中理解。"},{"icon":"🗂️","title":"可以归档","tone":"teal","body":"每个界面保存为你自己的页面，带完整版本历史；你修改过的地方，Agent 下次会接着做，也可以导出交给别人。"},{"icon":"🌱","title":"在使用中进化","tone":"violet","body":"缺少合适的表达时，Agent 会写出新组件；好用的页面可以沉淀为模板，下一次从更好的起点开始。"}]},"integrity":"sha256-96ea3af150bd5892ccd24a456bfe0fa6c6c312635d9b19e4a1bcf063be65ffa1"},"id":"node-f065c79c"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-f365cc55"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"三步开始"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"ShowAI 在你已经在用的 Agent 里工作：装上插件后，Agent 就能把回答做成界面；ShowAI App 负责保存、打开和继续编辑这些界面。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-f265cac2"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"需要：Apple Silicon Mac（macOS 13 或更高版本），以及已登录的 Claude Code 或 Codex（也可以在 App 中填写模型 API Key）。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-f565cf7b"}},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-steps","version":"1.0.0","props":{"steps":[{"title":"下载 ShowAI","body":"打开 DMG，把 ShowAI 拖进「应用程序」。下载[最新版本](https://github.com/Renaissance-Mind/ShowAI/releases/latest)。"},{"title":"在欢迎页连接你的 Agent","body":"打开 ShowAI，欢迎页会检测 Claude Code 与 Codex；点「安装插件」，然后重启 Agent。"},{"title":"让 Agent 做第一个界面","body":"在新对话中粘贴示例提示词：\n“用 ShowAI 帮我做一个房贷计算器：房价、首付比例、利率和贷款年限可以调整，显示月供和总利息。”"}]},"integrity":"sha256-660edad476b2fda02cf5d65a2e90470d95d7c2335d975efaa102a0360d58f20a"},"id":"node-f465cde8"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"首次打开被 macOS 阻止、插件面板的各种状态和更多示例，见 "},{"type":"text","text":"快速上手","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/quick-start"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-842f6a20"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-852f6bb3"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"ShowAI 怎样工作"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"下图是一个界面从提问到分享经过的地方。点选任一部分，查看说明和对应文档。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-862f6d46"}},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-diagram","version":"1.0.0","props":{"nodes":[{"id":"you","label":"你","sub":"提问 · 阅读 · 修改","col":0,"row":0,"tone":"brand","icon":"🙂","detail":"在 Agent 里描述想要的界面；拿到后直接操作，也可以在 App 中修改文字、图表和组件参数。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/quick-start"},{"id":"workbench","label":"ShowAI App","sub":"项目 · 页面 · 白板","col":1,"row":0,"tone":"brand","detail":"保存、打开和继续编辑界面。页面（Page）按顺序排版，白板（Board）自由摆放，两者可以互相嵌套。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/page-board"},{"id":"agent","label":"Agent","sub":"Claude Code · Codex","col":0,"row":2,"tone":"teal","icon":"🤖","detail":"Claude Code 与 Codex 从 App 的「设置 → 插件」一键安装插件；App 里也有内置 Agent。其他 Agent 的状态见「在 Agent 中使用」。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/agent-hosts"},{"id":"mcp","label":"ShowAI 插件","sub":"技能 + 页面工具","col":1,"row":2,"tone":"teal","detail":"插件为 Agent 提供 ShowAI 的工具和技能。Agent 先读取完整页面，再带着版本号保存，**不会悄悄覆盖**你刚做的修改。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/skills"},{"id":"library","label":"内容库","sub":"默认 ~/.showai","col":2,"row":1,"tone":"slate","icon":"🗂️","detail":"项目、页面、组件和模板都保存在本机内容库中，带完整版本历史。冲突时双方内容都会保留，供你比较合并。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/library"},{"id":"sync","label":"Server / Cloud","sub":"按项目同步","col":2,"row":3,"tone":"warm","detail":"需要跨设备或多人协作时，连接自部署的 ShowAI Server 或 ShowAI Cloud。离线时照常编辑，联网后补上同步。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/project-server"},{"id":"export","label":"导出","sub":"HTML · 网站","col":3,"row":1,"tone":"violet","icon":"📤","detail":"单文件 HTML 带着阅读器、数据和组件，不装 ShowAI 也能离线交互；静态网站把一个项目的多页内容组织成带导航的站点。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/export"}],"edges":[{"from":"you","to":"workbench","label":"编辑"},{"from":"you","to":"agent","label":"提问"},{"from":"agent","to":"mcp","label":"调用工具"},{"from":"workbench","to":"library","label":"读写"},{"from":"mcp","to":"library","label":"读写"},{"from":"library","to":"sync","label":"同步","both":true,"dashed":true},{"from":"library","to":"export","label":"生成"}],"caption":"实线是本机内的读写；虚线是可选的跨设备同步。"},"integrity":"sha256-9ceb1b83b7337bd71c87cce10635d090629d4226ec970470ceee8ab26cee0038"},"id":"node-872f6ed9"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-882f706c"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"其他路径"}]},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-cards","version":"1.0.0","props":{"columns":2,"cards":[{"icon":"✍️","title":"不经过 Agent，自己建页","tag":"手动建页","tone":"brand","body":"新建项目，添加 Page 或 Board，输入 `/` 插入图表、表格和交互组件。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/page-board"},{"icon":"💬","title":"网页版 ChatGPT","tag":"邀请制","tone":"teal","body":"通过托管 MCP 与 ShowAI Cloud 账号接入，注册需要注册码或项目邀请。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/chatgpt"},{"icon":"🧱","title":"做组件和模板","tag":"React · JSON","tone":"violet","body":"把常用的表达做成可复用的 React 组件，把成型的页面结构保存为模板，供其他项目使用。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/component-dev"},{"icon":"👥","title":"部署给团队","tag":"Server · Cloud","tone":"warm","body":"自部署 ShowAI Server 或连接 ShowAI Cloud，按项目跨设备同步，分配管理员、编辑者和查看者。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/project-server"}]},"integrity":"sha256-96ea3af150bd5892ccd24a456bfe0fa6c6c312635d9b19e4a1bcf063be65ffa1"},"id":"node-892f71ff"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-8a2f7392"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"全部文档"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3,"id":"node-8b2f7525"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"入门"}]},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-cards","version":"1.0.0","props":{"columns":2,"variant":"row","cards":[{"icon":"🚀","title":"快速上手","body":"下载 App，连接 Claude Code 或 Codex，让 Agent 做出第一个界面，再继续修改和分享。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/quick-start"},{"icon":"🧩","title":"Page 与 Board","body":"不经过 Agent 自己建页；Page 与 Board 的嵌套、白板编辑、阅读锁和快捷键。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/page-board"},{"icon":"🧭","title":"核心概念","body":"内容库、项目、页面、白板、组件、模板和版本，各是什么、怎么关联。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/concepts"}]},"integrity":"sha256-96ea3af150bd5892ccd24a456bfe0fa6c6c312635d9b19e4a1bcf063be65ffa1"},"id":"node-8c2f76b8"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3,"id":"node-8d2f784b"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"使用工作台"}]},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-cards","version":"1.0.0","props":{"columns":2,"variant":"row","cards":[{"icon":"💻","title":"安装与运行","body":"下载 macOS App，或从源码运行浏览器版；内容存在哪里，如何更新。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/install"},{"icon":"🧱","title":"组件与模板","body":"查找和插入组件，编辑参数，使用模板，管理版本与派生。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/components"},{"icon":"📊","title":"图表、导图与图形","body":"G2 数据图表、思维导图、流程图和其他内置图形。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/visuals"},{"icon":"📤","title":"导出与分享","body":"单文件 HTML、会话片段和静态网站，各自包含什么、何时使用。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/export"}]},"integrity":"sha256-96ea3af150bd5892ccd24a456bfe0fa6c6c312635d9b19e4a1bcf063be65ffa1"},"id":"node-16370bbb"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3,"id":"node-15370a28"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"与 Agent 协作"}]},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-cards","version":"1.0.0","props":{"columns":2,"variant":"row","cards":[{"icon":"🤝","title":"在 Agent 中使用","body":"支持的 Agent 及状态，从 App 安装插件，内容库与项目，Agent 怎样处理页面。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/agent-hosts"},{"icon":"🔍","title":"连接 Agent 时的常见问题","body":"Agent 找不到 ShowAI、插件未启用、页面找不到时，按看到的情况处理。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/agent-troubleshooting"},{"icon":"💬","title":"网页版 ChatGPT（邀请制）","body":"账号开通、托管 MCP 配置、登录授权、第一份页面和更新方法。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/chatgpt"},{"icon":"🤖","title":"内置 Agent","body":"工作台里的 Agent：模型来源、执行位置、权限和项目绑定。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/built-in-agent"},{"icon":"🧠","title":"技能与工作流程","body":"插件里的各个技能分别处理什么任务，以及从规划到交付的工作流程。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/skills"}]},"integrity":"sha256-96ea3af150bd5892ccd24a456bfe0fa6c6c312635d9b19e4a1bcf063be65ffa1"},"id":"node-18370ee1"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3,"id":"node-17370d4e"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"保存、同步与协作"}]},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-cards","version":"1.0.0","props":{"columns":2,"variant":"row","cards":[{"icon":"🗂️","title":"内容库与版本","body":"存储方式、搜索、草稿与冲突、备份和维护。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/library"},{"icon":"👥","title":"项目服务器与团队协作","body":"自部署服务器、账号与设备、角色邀请和同步时机。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/project-server"},{"icon":"☁️","title":"ShowAI Cloud","body":"ShowAI Cloud 的账号、项目、存储配额和离线工作。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/cloud"},{"icon":"🛠️","title":"服务器运维","body":"导出与恢复、迁移、可达性检查和上传中断处理。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/operations"}]},"integrity":"sha256-96ea3af150bd5892ccd24a456bfe0fa6c6c312635d9b19e4a1bcf063be65ffa1"},"id":"node-1a371207"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3,"id":"node-19371074"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"开发参考"}]},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-cards","version":"1.0.0","props":{"columns":2,"variant":"row","cards":[{"icon":"🏗️","title":"架构","body":"桌面、浏览器、CLI 和 MCP 入口如何共用同一套核心。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/architecture"},{"icon":"📄","title":"页面文件格式","body":"页面 JSON：信封、容器、文本块和组件数据。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/file-format"},{"icon":"🧪","title":"开发自定义组件","body":"组件包结构、参数说明、导入、版本、派生与发布。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/component-dev"},{"icon":"⌨️","title":"CLI 与 MCP 参考","body":"全部 CLI 命令与 MCP 工具，可搜索。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/cli"}]},"integrity":"sha256-96ea3af150bd5892ccd24a456bfe0fa6c6c312635d9b19e4a1bcf063be65ffa1"},"id":"node-1c37152d"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-1b37139a"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"常见问题"}]},{"type":"toggle","attrs":{"title":"用 ShowAI 需要注册账号或联网吗？","open":false,"id":"node-e36ff23"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"不需要。App 在本机运行，内容保存在本机内容库。Agent 本身需要按它的方式登录和联网；只有跨设备同步或多人协作时，才需要连接 "},{"type":"text","text":"项目服务器","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/project-server"}}]},{"type":"text","text":" 或 "},{"type":"text","text":"ShowAI Cloud","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/cloud"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-c0323abc"}}]},{"type":"toggle","attrs":{"title":"支持哪些 Agent？","open":false,"id":"node-d36fd90"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Claude Code、Codex 和内置 Agent 已正式支持，Claude Code 与 Codex 在 App「设置 → 插件」中一键安装插件。DeepSeek Harness 和 Kimi 处于预览阶段，网页版 ChatGPT 为邀请制，其他 MCP 客户端可以手动配置（实验）。详见 "},{"type":"text","text":"在 Agent 中使用","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/agent-hosts"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-e5f90027"}}]},{"type":"toggle","attrs":{"title":"用的是 Windows 或 Linux？","open":false,"id":"node-9033fa32"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"目前发布的 App 只支持 Apple Silicon Mac。Windows 与 Linux 可以从源码运行本地浏览器版，见 "},{"type":"text","text":"安装与运行","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/install"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-1cbd4eb5"}}]},{"type":"toggle","attrs":{"title":"App 和 Agent 能看到同一批项目吗？","open":false,"id":"node-9133fbc5"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"能，前提是它们指向同一个内容库。从 App 安装的插件使用 App 当前的内容库；切换内容库或移动 App 后，在「设置 → 插件」点「更新并启用」。内容库在「设置 → 通用 → 内容库」中选择。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-1833f02a"}}]},{"type":"toggle","attrs":{"title":"我正在改的页面，Agent 也在改，会互相覆盖吗？","open":false,"id":"node-8e33f70c"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"不会。后保存的一方会被暂停，两份内容都保留下来供比较；你可以选择「比较并合并」或「保留为副本」。详见 "},{"type":"text","text":"内容库与版本","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/library"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-475d248b"}}]},{"type":"toggle","attrs":{"title":"导出的 HTML 发给别人，对方需要安装什么？","open":false,"id":"node-8f33f89f"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"什么都不用装。单文件 HTML 带着阅读器、数据和组件，用浏览器打开即可，图表、折叠区域和本地计算离线可用；外部链接仍需联网，图片要内嵌到页面。详见 "},{"type":"text","text":"导出与分享","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/export"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-a234f960"}}]},{"type":"toggle","attrs":{"title":"界面能切换成英文吗？","open":false,"id":"node-8c33f3e6"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"可以。工作台支持简体中文和英文，默认「跟随系统」，在「设置 → 外观 → 语言」中切换。导出页面的阅读器控件使用导出时的语言。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-f10eae41"}}]},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"icon":"✍️","tone":"sand","id":"node-8d33f579"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"文档有错误或缺漏？欢迎在 "},{"type":"text","text":"GitHub Issues","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://github.com/Renaissance-Mind/ShowAI/issues"}}]},{"type":"text","text":" 反馈，附上运行环境、软件版本和复现步骤。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-4be68316"}}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-8a33f0c0"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"接下来"}]},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-cards","version":"1.0.0","props":{"columns":3,"cards":[{"icon":"🚀","title":"快速上手","body":"三步开始：下载、连接 Agent、做出第一个界面。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/quick-start"},{"icon":"🧩","title":"手动建页：Page 与 Board","body":"不经过 Agent，自己新建项目和页面。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/page-board"},{"icon":"🧭","title":"核心概念","body":"先弄清内容库、项目、页面和组件的关系。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/concepts"}]},"integrity":"sha256-96ea3af150bd5892ccd24a456bfe0fa6c6c312635d9b19e4a1bcf063be65ffa1"},"id":"node-8b33f253"}}]},"layout":{},"surfaceViews":{"root":{"initial":null,"saved":[],"read